  "name": "Prestige tells the client the hearthstone was rebound to the starting location (COA-6147)",
  "contract": [
    "Prestige rebinds the hearthstone to the racial starting location with Player::SetHomebind, which only saved it:",
    "SMSG_BINDPOINTUPDATE (0x155) was sent by the Bind spell effect alone, so the hearthstone tooltip kept the old home",
    "until the next login. SetHomebind now sends the packet itself. A human bound in Stormwind (x -8816) who prestiges",
    "is sent a bind point at Northshire (x -8949.95)."
  ],
